      the candidate's OWN ceiling is the tightest of the family, C = 1/e = 0.3679.  Beyond 2 kpc, 9.8% of points (263 of 2352)
      exceed it by more than 3 sigma, spread over 32 of 144 galaxies -- this is NOT a handful of outliers, it is the transition region of the ordinary population.
